#. module: payment_xpago
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_xpago.field_payment_provider__xpago_notify_user_ids
msgid ""
"These users get an Odoo notification (inbox and pop-up) for each payment "
"received with XPago."
msgstr ""
"Estos usuarios reciben un aviso en Odoo (bandeja de entrada y ventana "
"emergente) por cada pago que entra con XPago."

#. module: payment_xpago
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_xpago.payment_provider_form
msgid ""
"Which months without interest the checkout offers, by amount of the sale. Each rule applies\n"
"                        from its amount up to the next one. Your customer pays no interest: the fee of each plan is\n"
"                        paid by your business. Without rules, the checkout offers every plan active in your XPago\n"
"                        account."
msgstr ""
"Qué meses sin intereses ofrece el pago según el monto de la venta. Cada "
"regla aplica desde su monto hasta la siguiente. Tu cliente no paga "
"intereses: la comisión de cada plazo la paga tu negocio. Sin reglas, se "
"ofrecen todos los planes activos en tu cuenta de XPago."

